post-trained.\nL118: Note: This update only upgrades the DeepSeek-V4-Flash API. The DeepSeek-V4-Pro API and the APP/WEB models are unchanged.\nL119: The official release of DeepSeek-V4-Pro will follow soon.\nL120: \nL121: * * *\nL122: ## Date: 2026-04-24cite16†​ L123: ### DeepSeek-V4cite17†​ L124: \nL125: The DeepSeek API now supports V4-Pro and V4-Flash, available via both the OpenAI ChatCompletions interface and the Anthropic interface. To access the new models, the base_url remains unchanged, and the model parameter should be set to `deepseek-v4-pro` or `deepseek-v4-flash`.\nL126: The two legacy API model names, `deepseek-chat` and `deepseek-reasoner`, will be discontinued in three months (2026-07-24). During the current period, these two model names point to the non-thinking mode and thinking mode of `deepseek-v4-flash`, respectively.\nL127: \nL128: For more details, please refer to cite18†this documentation .\nL129: \nL130: * * *\nL341:   * cite2†Date: 2026-09-10 L342:     * cite3†DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash Release L343:   * cite6†Date: 2026-08-21 L344:     * cite7†DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp Release L345:   * cite9†Date: 2026-08-13 L346:     * cite10†DeepSeek-V4-Pro Update L347:   * cite14†Date: 2026-07-31 L348:     * cite15†DeepSeek-V4-Flash Update L349:   * cite16†Date: 2026-04-24 L350:     * cite17†DeepSeek-V4 L351:   * cite19†Date: 2025-12-01 L352:     * cite20†DeepSeek-V3.2 L353:     * cite21†DeepSeek-V3.2-Speciale L354:   * cite24†Date: 2025-09-29 L355:     * cite25†DeepSeek-V3.2-Exp L356:   * cite27†Date: 2025-09-22 L357:     * cite28†DeepSeek-V3.1-Terminus --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nGitHub - QwenLM/Qwen3.8: Qwen3.8 is the large language model series developed by Qwen team, Alibaba Group. · GitHub (https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3.5)\nciteturn31839view4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: find({\"ref_id\":\"turn31838